WEBVTT

00:08.862 --> 00:10.068
Are you ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.172 --> 00:11.896
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:12.000 --> 00:13.517
I can't hear you.
我听不到你说话。

00:13.620 --> 00:15.344
Aye, aye, Captain!
是啊是啊，队长！

00:15.448 --> 00:18.482
♪ Oh...
♪ 哦...

00:18.586 --> 00:20.413
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.517 --> 00:22.551
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:22.655 --> 00:24.931
♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he. ♪
♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的。 ♪

00:25.034 --> 00:26.448
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:26.551 --> 00:28.655
♪ If nautical nonsense be
something you wish... ♪
♪ 如果航海方面的废话是
你想要的东西...♪

00:28.758 --> 00:30.172
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:30.275 --> 00:32.724
♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish. ♪
♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通。 ♪

00:32.827 --> 00:34.448
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:34.551 --> 00:36.344
♪ Ready?
SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 准备好了吗？
海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:36.448 --> 00:39.344
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:39.448 --> 00:40.344
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:40.448 --> 00:42.034
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:45.344 --> 00:47.827
Captioning sponsored by THE
U.S. DEPARTMENT OF EDUCATION
字幕由 THE 赞助
美国教育部

00:47.931 --> 00:50.586
and NICKELODEON
和尼克国际儿童频道

01:02.068 --> 01:05.482
Oh, a dark and stormy night.
哦，一个漆黑的暴风雨之夜。

01:05.586 --> 01:08.862
It's nights like this
that remind me of the time
都是这样的夜晚
这让我想起了那个时候

01:08.965 --> 01:13.241
Mr. Krabs and SpongeBob
thought they killed
the health inspector.
蟹老板和海绵宝宝
以为他们杀了
卫生督察。

01:13.344 --> 01:16.448
It was a bright
and sunny morning...
那是一个明亮的
和阳光明媚的早晨...

01:21.551 --> 01:22.758
Ah...
啊...

01:24.620 --> 01:26.413
That smells like...
那味道就像...

01:27.586 --> 01:28.793
The health inspector!
卫生督察！

01:28.896 --> 01:30.896
Wash your hands,
clean the floors
洗手，
清洁地板

01:31.000 --> 01:32.620
change your underwear!
换内衣吧！

01:32.724 --> 01:34.448
The health inspector's here!
卫生督察来了！

01:34.551 --> 01:36.620
If he finds one health violation
如果他发现一项健康违规行为

01:36.724 --> 01:38.379
he'll close us down for good.
他会永远关闭我们。

01:38.482 --> 01:41.068
We've got to
do everything
in our power
我们必须
做所有事情
在我们的力量范围内

01:41.172 --> 01:43.448
to make sure
he passes
The Krusty Krab.
以确保
他通过了
蟹堡王。

01:43.551 --> 01:46.448
But, Mr. Krabs,
there's no reason to worry.
但是，蟹老板，
没有理由担心。

01:46.551 --> 01:50.344
The Krusty Krab is the most
perfect place in the universe.
蟹堡王是最
宇宙中完美的地方。

01:50.448 --> 01:53.310
You really haven't got any
brains at all, have you, son?
你真的一无所有
儿子，你有脑子吗？

01:53.413 --> 01:55.758
Just go out there and
give him what he needs.
只要走出去，
给他他需要的东西。

01:55.862 --> 01:58.000
Pour on the charm.
倾注魅力。

01:58.103 --> 01:59.689
Sweet-talk him.
跟他甜言蜜语。

01:59.793 --> 02:03.379
What can I get for
you... Handsome?
我能得到什么
你……帅吗？

02:03.482 --> 02:05.448
We're doomed!
我们注定了！

02:05.551 --> 02:07.103
I'm going to need you
to bring me
我需要你
带我来

02:07.206 --> 02:08.896
one of everything on the menu.
菜单上的所有内容之一。

02:09.000 --> 02:10.655
Excellent choice, my darling.
很棒的选择，我亲爱的。

02:10.758 --> 02:11.758
Coming right up!
马上就来了！

02:11.793 --> 02:14.000
He wants one of everything!
他什么都想要！

02:14.103 --> 02:17.172
Then we'll give him
a smorgasbord!
那我们就给他
自助餐！

02:17.275 --> 02:19.137
The future of The Krusty Krab
is at stake.
蟹堡王的未来
正处于危险之中。

02:19.241 --> 02:20.862
Try the Crunchy Kelp Dogs, sir.
尝尝脆脆的海带热狗吧，先生。

02:20.965 --> 02:22.413
The Buttered Barnacles
are heaven.
涂黄油的藤壶
是天堂。

02:22.517 --> 02:24.103
The Powdered Driftwood
is exquisite.
粉状浮木
很精致。

02:24.206 --> 02:25.000
Sludge Pudding?
污泥布丁？

02:25.103 --> 02:26.344
More Diet Red Tide?
更多饮食赤潮？

02:26.448 --> 02:27.034
Fried Flotsam?
油炸漂浮物？

02:27.137 --> 02:28.793
Please, gentlemen!
拜托了，先生们！

02:30.551 --> 02:32.448
Leave me to finish my work
in peace.
让我完成我的工作
平静地。

02:37.413 --> 02:40.655
And did the voluptuous
inspector enjoy his meal?
And did the voluptuous
检查员吃得开心吗？

02:40.758 --> 02:41.793
So far so good.
到目前为止，一切都很好。

02:41.896 --> 02:44.413
I just need to try
a plain Krabby Patty
我只需要尝试
普通的蟹肉饼

02:44.517 --> 02:47.000
and my inspection
will be finished.
和我的检查
将会完成。

02:47.103 --> 02:49.448
He says if he gets
one more Krabby Patty
他说如果他得到
再来一份蟹肉饼

02:49.551 --> 02:51.586
he'll pass us
for the inspection!
他会超越我们
用于检查！

02:51.689 --> 02:53.793
Do you know what
this means, dear boy?
你知道什么吗
这意味着，亲爱的孩子？

02:53.896 --> 02:55.551
We're in the clear!
我们很清楚！

02:58.655 --> 03:00.689
We interrupt this cancan
我们打断这康康舞

03:00.793 --> 03:02.275
for a special news bulletin.
以获得特别新闻公告。

03:02.379 --> 03:03.793
Be on the lookout for a man
留意一个男人

03:03.896 --> 03:06.310
who's been passing himself off
as a health inspector
谁在冒充自己
作为一名卫生督察

03:06.413 --> 03:06.965
in order to obtain free food.
以获取免费食物。

03:07.068 --> 03:09.586
That's all for now.
现在就这些了。

03:10.965 --> 03:14.862
Free... food..!
免费...食物..！

03:14.965 --> 03:18.000
Maybe we ought to tell our guy
about the phony impostor.
也许我们应该告诉我们的人
关于冒名顶替者。

03:18.103 --> 03:20.620
You loony loofah!
He isthe impostor!
你这个疯子丝瓜！
他就是冒名顶替者！

03:20.724 --> 03:21.758
We've been duped!
我们被骗了！

03:21.862 --> 03:22.724
Duped!
受骗了！

03:22.827 --> 03:23.620
Bamboozled!
迷惑了！

03:23.724 --> 03:24.862
Smeckledorfed!
斯梅克尔多夫！

03:24.965 --> 03:25.586
That's not even a word
这甚至不是一个字

03:25.689 --> 03:26.862
and I agree with ya!
我同意你的观点！

03:26.965 --> 03:28.172
Look at him...
看看他...

03:28.275 --> 03:30.620
I bet he never
changes his underpants.
我打赌他永远不会
换内裤。

03:30.724 --> 03:33.103
I bet he bites whale bubbles.
我打赌他会咬鲸鱼泡泡。

03:33.206 --> 03:35.379
I bet his mom
bought him that hat.
我打赌他妈妈
给他买了那顶帽子。

03:35.482 --> 03:38.620
If that impostor
wants a Krabby Patty...
如果那个骗子
想要一个蟹肉饼...

03:38.724 --> 03:42.137
Then, by Neptune,
we'll give him one!
然后，通过海王星，
我们就给他一个！

03:43.344 --> 03:45.758
You're dancing with
the Krab man now!
你正在与
现在是蟹蟹人了！

03:45.862 --> 03:47.724
Join me, boy, or you're fired.
加入我吧，孩子，不然你就被解雇了。

03:47.827 --> 03:50.172
It doesn't seem right...
好像不太对劲...

03:50.275 --> 03:52.413
but it feels so good!
但感觉真好！

03:52.517 --> 03:55.827
Sea horse radish, the
gnarliest stuff in the ocean!
海马萝卜，
海洋中最粗糙的东西！

03:55.931 --> 03:59.931
Oh, hold on! I've got a jar of
toenail clippings in my office.
哦，坚持住！我有一罐
我的办公室里有剪下来的脚趾甲。

04:00.034 --> 04:02.586
Oops, I dropped it
in the toilet.
哎呀，我把它掉了
在厕所里。

04:02.689 --> 04:06.172
Well, fish it out and
I'll dry it with me gym socks!
好吧，把它捞出来然后
我会用运动袜把它擦干！

04:08.206 --> 04:13.965
Why, that's the most diabolical
Krabby Patty ever spawned.
为什么，这是最邪恶的
蟹蟹派蒂曾经生成过。

04:14.068 --> 04:17.068
I call it...
The Nasty Patty.
我称之为...
可恶的帕蒂。

04:19.620 --> 04:22.241
Hey, hurry up with that patty!
嘿，快点吃那个馅饼！

04:22.344 --> 04:23.827
Here you are sir, enjoy.
先生，你来了，享受吧。

04:23.931 --> 04:25.965
Ah! Hello, delicious!
啊!你好，好吃！

04:26.068 --> 04:27.965
Come to papa.
来找爸爸吧。

04:32.896 --> 04:34.793
Listen! He ate it!
听！他吃了它！

04:34.896 --> 04:36.206
Look at him choke!
看他噎住了！

04:38.448 --> 04:40.068
Look at him suffer!
看他受苦！

04:45.965 --> 04:47.896
Did you see that boy?
你看到那个男孩了吗？

04:48.000 --> 04:50.620
Oh, man, the look on his face!
哦，伙计，他脸上的表情！

05:01.068 --> 05:04.310
We interrupt your laughter
at other people's expense
我们打断你的笑声
以他人为代价

05:04.413 --> 05:06.413
to bring you this news flash!
为您带来这个快讯！

05:06.517 --> 05:08.724
The fake inspector
has been captured.
假督察
已被捕获。

05:08.827 --> 05:09.931
Here is his picture.
这是他的照片。

05:10.034 --> 05:12.620
If a health inspector
comes to your restaurant
如果卫生检查员
来到你的餐厅

05:12.724 --> 05:14.655
and he's not this guy...
he's real.
而他不是这个人……
他是真实的。

05:14.758 --> 05:16.655
Phew! That's a relief,
eh, Mr. Krabs?
唷！这真是一种解脱，
嗯，蟹老板？

05:16.758 --> 05:18.482
I'm sure our guy will understand
我相信我们的人会理解的

05:18.586 --> 05:20.344
if we just explain
the situation.
如果我们只是解释一下
情况。

05:20.448 --> 05:22.862
Then we can all have
a good laugh about it.
那么我们都可以拥有
对此大笑。

05:24.275 --> 05:26.172
I don't think
he'll be laughing, boy.
我不认为
他会笑的，孩子。

05:26.275 --> 05:27.275
Why, sir?
为什么，先生？

05:27.344 --> 05:29.068
Because that patty killed him!
因为那个小馅饼杀了他！

05:36.448 --> 05:37.172
Mr. Krabs, what
are we gonna do?
蟹老板，什么？
我们要做什么？

05:37.275 --> 05:39.310
What's this "we" stuff?
这个“我们”是什么东西？

05:39.413 --> 05:41.103
You fed him the tainted patty!
你给他吃了受污染的肉饼！

05:41.206 --> 05:43.241
Looks like it's
the stony lonesome for you.
看起来好像是
对你来说是冷漠的孤独。

05:43.344 --> 05:45.275
But you told me
to give it to him!
但你告诉我
把它给他！

05:45.379 --> 05:47.379
Well, you could have
talked me out of it!
好吧，你可以有
劝我别这么做了！

05:47.482 --> 05:50.241
You're right, Mr. Krabs...
I'm guilty!
你是对的，蟹老板……
我有罪！

05:50.344 --> 05:52.482
I'll never survive in prison.
我在监狱里永远活不下去。

05:52.586 --> 05:54.896
They'll mop up the floor
with me!
他们会擦地板
和我一起！

05:55.000 --> 05:56.517
Get a hold of yerself, boy!
控制住自己吧，孩子！

05:56.620 --> 05:58.413
We got to get rid of this body
我们必须摆脱这个身体

05:58.517 --> 06:00.068
before anyone sees it.
在任何人看到之前。

06:00.172 --> 06:02.206
We got to take it out
and bury it.
我们得把它拿出来
并埋葬它。

06:02.310 --> 06:04.034
Eww, gross, germs.
呃，恶心，细菌。

06:04.137 --> 06:06.275
It's all icky and corpse-y!
一切都恶心又死气沉沉！

06:12.172 --> 06:15.068
Eww... eww...
呃……呃……

06:15.172 --> 06:16.931
This should be far enough.
这应该足够远了。

06:17.034 --> 06:18.034
Now, get diggin'!
现在，开始挖掘吧！

06:18.068 --> 06:19.068
Yes, sir.
是的，先生。

06:22.344 --> 06:23.689
What's the holdup down there?
下面有什么阻碍？

06:23.793 --> 06:25.689
There's a big rock in the way!
路上有一块大石头挡住了！

06:25.793 --> 06:28.344
Well, toss it out
and get back to diggin'!
那就扔掉吧
然后回去挖掘吧！

06:28.448 --> 06:30.068
Aye, aye, sir!
是啊，是啊，先生！

06:31.862 --> 06:34.206
Oh... where am I?
哦……我在哪儿？

06:38.275 --> 06:40.137
Somethin' ain't quite right.
有些事情不太对劲。

06:40.241 --> 06:42.965
What do you mean,
Mr. Krabs?
你是什么意思，
蟹老板？

06:43.068 --> 06:44.689
His head's sticking out!
他的头伸出来了！

06:44.793 --> 06:47.482
Sorry, Mr. Krabs, I thought
he might need some air.
抱歉，蟹老板，我以为
他可能需要一些空气。

06:47.586 --> 06:50.172
They don't need air
where he's goin'.
他们不需要空气
他要去哪里。

06:50.275 --> 06:52.344
Shouldn't we say a few
words on his behalf?
难道我们不应该说几句吗
代表他的话？

06:52.448 --> 06:56.137
Uh... he was a credit
to health inspectors
everywhere, and, uh...
呃……他是一个功劳
给卫生检查员
到处都是，而且，呃...

06:56.241 --> 07:00.068
What a brave man, going in
the line of duty like that.
多么勇敢的人啊，进去了
像这样的职责。

07:00.172 --> 07:04.206
Why... why... why..?!
为什么……为什么……为什么……？！

07:04.310 --> 07:05.965
Listen here, ya little barnacle.
听着，你这个小藤壶。

07:06.068 --> 07:08.931
No one, and I mean no one
can ever know about this.
没有人，我的意思是没有人
可以知道这件事。

07:09.034 --> 07:11.517
It'll be the end of you,
it'll be the end of me.
这将是你的终结
这将是我的终结。

07:11.620 --> 07:14.034
And worst of all,
it'll be the end of me!
最糟糕的是，
这将是我的终结！

07:14.137 --> 07:15.689
Stop right where you are!
就在你所在的地方停下来！

07:15.793 --> 07:18.344
I'm afraid we're gonna have to
arrest the two of you.
恐怕我们不得不
逮捕你们两个。

07:18.448 --> 07:20.586
Mr. Krabs!
I'm too young
to go to jail!
蟹老板！
我还太年轻
去监狱吧！

07:20.689 --> 07:22.413
And what would be the charges?
费用是多少？

07:22.517 --> 07:25.068
For not being at The Krusty Krab
因为没有去The Krusty Krab

07:25.172 --> 07:29.517
to whip us up a couple of
dee... licious Krabby Patties.
鞭打我们几个
迪伊……美味的蟹肉饼。

07:32.586 --> 07:33.586
Laugh, boy.
笑吧，男孩。

07:46.344 --> 07:47.664
Put that muddy shovel
in the trunk
放上那把泥铲
在后备箱里

07:47.689 --> 07:49.000
and we'll give you a ride back.
我们会送你回来。

07:53.793 --> 07:55.689
SpongeBob, listen carefully.
海绵宝宝，仔细听。

07:55.793 --> 07:59.137
We're just getting a lift
back to the Krusty Krab.
我们只是搭便车
回到蟹堡王。

07:59.241 --> 08:03.241
I need you to stay calm
and don't lose your cool,
understand?
我需要你保持冷静
并且不要失去冷静，
明白吗？

08:03.344 --> 08:05.896
Can I lose my cool now?
我现在可以失去冷静吗？

08:06.000 --> 08:07.689
Why?
为什么？

08:09.000 --> 08:10.241
Aah!
啊啊！

08:10.344 --> 08:11.620
Put him in the trunk, boy!
把他放进后备箱吧，孩子！

08:11.724 --> 08:13.379
I'll keep them cops busy.
我会让他们的警察忙起来。

08:13.482 --> 08:15.172
What's the holdup back there?
后面有什么阻碍吗？

08:15.275 --> 08:16.862
Oh, Neptune!
哦，海王星！

08:16.965 --> 08:18.379
Get away!
逃离！

08:18.482 --> 08:21.896
Ooh... ahh-ahh...
噢……啊啊啊……

08:22.000 --> 08:23.965
A-hem...
啊哼……

08:24.068 --> 08:25.517
Okay! All set
back here.
好的！一切就绪
回到这里。

08:25.620 --> 08:27.580
Nothing unusual about
a muddy shovel in the trunk.
没什么不寻常的
后备箱里有一把泥铲。

08:29.448 --> 08:31.034
All set.
一切就绪。

08:31.137 --> 08:35.379
Ahh...
啊...

08:35.482 --> 08:36.758
You okay there, little fella?
你还好吗，小家伙？

08:36.862 --> 08:39.724
Ooh, he gets carsick real easy.
哦，他很容易晕车。

08:39.827 --> 08:43.379
Well, buckle up and
we'll drive real smooth-like.
好吧，系好安全带
我们将驾驶得非常平稳。

08:44.551 --> 08:46.172
Now listen, SpongeBob
现在听着，海绵宝宝

08:46.275 --> 08:47.355
when we get to the Krusty Krab
当我们到达蟹堡王时

08:47.379 --> 08:49.310
I want you to take
我要你带

08:49.413 --> 08:51.448
that shovel
那把铲子

08:51.551 --> 08:53.655
and bring it around
to the back entrance
并把它带到身边
到后门

08:53.758 --> 08:56.413
and stuff... er...
I mean, stow it
in the freezer.
还有东西...呃...
我的意思是，把它收起来
在冰箱里。

08:56.517 --> 08:57.620
Un... der... stand?
理解？

08:57.724 --> 08:59.310
I understand, Mr. Krabs
我明白了，蟹老板

08:59.413 --> 09:01.827
but what do you want me
to do with the bo...
但你想要我做什么
与...有关

09:01.931 --> 09:03.482
tles of soda!
Bottles of soda.
苏打水！
瓶装苏打水。

09:03.586 --> 09:05.275
Same thing, put 'em
in the freezer.
同样的事情，把它们
在冰箱里。

09:06.344 --> 09:07.448
Oh...
哦...

09:11.103 --> 09:15.482
Eww... eww... eww...
呃……呃……呃……

09:15.586 --> 09:18.862
Oh, man, this is so gross!
哦，伙计，这太恶心了！

09:22.758 --> 09:24.137
The back door is locked!
后门锁着！

09:24.241 --> 09:25.241
What am I gonna do?!
我要做什么？！

09:31.517 --> 09:32.896
Ahoy there, SpongeBob.
嘿，海绵宝宝。

09:33.000 --> 09:35.448
Heh. I thought
you were out back
呵呵。我以为
你在外面

09:35.551 --> 09:37.413
takin' care of that shovel.
照顾那把铲子。

09:37.517 --> 09:41.137
Well, the back door was locked,
so I came around here... eh.
嗯，后门锁着，
所以我来到这里...呃。

09:41.241 --> 09:42.310
So if you'll excuse me
所以如果你能原谅我

09:42.413 --> 09:44.655
I'm gonna go put my hat
in the freezer now.
我要去把我的帽子
现在在冰箱里。

09:44.758 --> 09:47.000
Okey-dokey, SpongeBob.
好吧，海绵宝宝。

09:47.103 --> 09:47.827
Is that kid okay?
那孩子还好吗？

09:47.931 --> 09:49.482
He's actin' a little funny.
他的行为有点滑稽。

09:49.586 --> 09:51.172
Funny? Oh. Yeah.
有趣的？哦。是的。

09:51.275 --> 09:52.793
He's a real cut-up, that one.
他真是个废物。

09:52.896 --> 09:55.275
He knows how to keep
the crew in stitches.
他知道如何保持
船员们都紧张极了。

09:55.379 --> 09:56.379
Good one, boy!
好样的，小伙子！

09:56.413 --> 09:57.620
Always on, that one.
永远在线，那个。

09:57.724 --> 09:59.896
There's no off
on his funny switch.
没有关掉
在他有趣的开关上。

10:01.448 --> 10:02.758
Oh, ha, oh, stop it.
啊啊啊啊啊别说了

10:02.862 --> 10:05.000
Oh, you're, you're killin' me.
哦，你，你要杀了我。

10:08.275 --> 10:09.275
Oh!
哦！

10:10.517 --> 10:12.448
Look, I almost forgot!
瞧，我差点忘了！

10:12.551 --> 10:14.000
It's open cash register night!
今晚是开放收银机之夜！

10:14.103 --> 10:15.689
First two customers
get all the money
前两位顾客
得到所有的钱

10:15.793 --> 10:16.965
in the cash register!
在收银机里！

10:24.551 --> 10:26.379
86 those patties, Krabs.
86 那些肉饼，蟹蟹。

10:26.482 --> 10:27.931
We just got a call
about two ghouls
我们刚刚接到电话
大约两个食尸鬼

10:28.034 --> 10:30.172
burying a stiff
over by Shallow Grave Road.
埋葬僵硬的
经过浅坟路。

10:30.275 --> 10:31.172
I want a soda.
我想要一杯苏打水。

10:31.275 --> 10:32.344
Here's your soda.
这是你的苏打水。

10:32.448 --> 10:33.448
Always a pleasure.
总是一种乐趣。

10:33.482 --> 10:34.482
Well, good-bye now.
好吧，现在再见了。

10:34.551 --> 10:36.482
Hey, there's no ice.
嘿，没有冰。

10:36.586 --> 10:37.931
Ice? Ice? You want ice?
冰？冰？你想要冰吗？

10:38.034 --> 10:41.137
Is that what you want,
you want ice?
这就是你想要的吗
你想要冰吗？

10:41.241 --> 10:42.137
The dark deed you requested
你要求的黑暗行为

10:42.241 --> 10:44.344
is done, sir.
完成了，先生。

10:44.448 --> 10:46.379
Ice is in the freezer, ri...?
冰箱里有冰，是吗……？

10:46.482 --> 10:47.482
There is no ice!
没有冰！

10:47.551 --> 10:48.448
There's never been any ice.
从来没有冰过。

10:48.551 --> 10:51.103
Ice is just a myth!
冰只是一个神话！

10:51.206 --> 10:52.310
Step aside.
退到一边去。

10:52.413 --> 10:54.213
You people act like
you've committed a murder!
你们的行为就像
你犯了谋杀罪！

10:56.137 --> 10:58.000
Okay! I confess!
好的！我承认！

10:58.103 --> 10:59.655
SpongeBob killed him!
海绵宝宝杀了他！

10:59.758 --> 11:01.620
What? You can't pin
this whole rap on me!
什么？你无法固定
这整个说唱都在我身上！

11:01.724 --> 11:03.172
He was insane, out of control.
他疯了，失控了。

11:03.275 --> 11:04.413
He would have killed me, too
他也会杀了我

11:04.517 --> 11:05.241
if you hadn't come along.
如果你没有来的话。

11:05.344 --> 11:06.931
It was all Mr. Krabs' idea.
这都是蟹老板的主意。

11:07.034 --> 11:08.758
Put him down now,
he's a mad dog!
赶紧把他放下来
他是一条疯狗！

11:08.862 --> 11:10.517
He wears curlers to bed!
他戴着卷发器睡觉！

11:10.620 --> 11:12.655
Wait! It's not
what you think!
等待！这不是
你怎么想！

11:12.758 --> 11:14.896
What are you two talking about?
你们两个在说什么？

11:15.000 --> 11:17.172
We killed the health inspector
我们杀了卫生检查员

11:17.275 --> 11:21.103
buried him, and then stuffed
his body in the freezer.
把他埋了，然后塞进去
他的尸体在冰箱里。

11:21.206 --> 11:22.586
You mean in here?
你是说这里？

11:24.344 --> 11:26.241
It's empty.
它是空的。

11:26.344 --> 11:27.384
Is this some kind of joke?
这是某种玩笑吗？

11:27.448 --> 11:29.586
Yeah... a joke!
是啊……开玩笑！

11:31.689 --> 11:34.206
Say, maybe he
turned into a zombie
说吧，也许他
变成了僵尸

11:34.310 --> 11:35.344
and walked out.
然后走了出去。

11:44.482 --> 11:47.137
Aah! It's the zombie!
啊啊！这是僵尸！

11:48.482 --> 11:49.586
You guys should...
你们应该...

11:49.689 --> 11:52.724
Take that, you zombie!
拿着这个，你这个僵尸！

11:52.827 --> 11:54.482
I'll take it from here.
我会从这里拿走它。

11:54.586 --> 11:55.931
Die, zombie!
去死吧，僵尸！

11:56.034 --> 11:57.314
Good police work, Officer Nancy.
警察干得好，南希警官。

11:58.862 --> 12:00.551
Hey, this guy's not a zombie.
嘿，这家伙不是僵尸。

12:00.655 --> 12:02.793
He's just an ordinary
health inspector.
他只是一个普通人
卫生督察。

12:02.896 --> 12:06.448
Yes, and at the risk
of being hit again
是的，并且有风险
再次被击中

12:06.551 --> 12:09.413
I'd like to present you
with this.
我想向您介绍
有了这个。

12:09.517 --> 12:10.689
Hey, Mr. Krabs, look.
嘿，蟹老板，看。

12:10.793 --> 12:11.793
We passed the inspection!
我们审核通过了！

12:14.758 --> 12:16.620
Come on, everybody!
加油，大家！

12:16.724 --> 12:18.551
Krabby Patties at half price!
蟹黄饼半价！

12:18.655 --> 12:20.448
Well, not really.
嗯，不是真的。

12:20.551 --> 12:23.827
Oh boy, I'd like a Krabby Patty.
天啊，我想要一份蟹肉饼。

12:23.931 --> 12:25.586
Well, that's the story.
嗯，这就是故事。

12:25.689 --> 12:28.000
Yes, theyare
all idiots, aren't they?
是的，他们是
都是白痴，不是吗？

12:43.344 --> 12:45.448
See anything yet, Patrick?
看到什么了吗，帕特里克？

12:45.551 --> 12:47.310
I need my glasses.
我需要我的眼镜。

12:50.137 --> 12:51.206
Hmm...
唔...

12:51.310 --> 12:53.448
It's the mail truck!
这是邮车！

12:53.551 --> 12:55.689
Our package!
我们的包裹！

12:59.896 --> 13:04.344
I didn't realize it was
Happy Hopping Moron Day.
我没有意识到这是
跳跃白痴日快乐。

13:05.586 --> 13:06.586
SpongeBob SquarePants?
海绵宝宝？

13:06.655 --> 13:07.655
That's me!
这就是我！

13:09.310 --> 13:11.206
That's a big box!
那是一个大盒子！

13:11.310 --> 13:12.206
Thank you.
谢谢。

13:12.310 --> 13:13.586
Hey, SpongeBob?
嘿，海绵宝宝？

13:13.689 --> 13:16.241
When do we stop hopping?
我们什么时候停止跳跃？

13:16.344 --> 13:18.448
30 more seconds, Patrick.
还有 30 秒，帕特里克。

13:18.551 --> 13:21.724
Probably ordered a lifetime
supply of bubble soap.
大概是一辈子的订单
供应泡泡皂。

13:26.000 --> 13:28.344
Huh?! A brand new television?
啊？！全新的电视？

13:28.448 --> 13:32.931
Easy... easy...
容易……容易……

13:38.103 --> 13:41.517
Just when I thought they
couldn't get any stupider.
正当我以为他们
再蠢不过了。

13:41.620 --> 13:43.586
Let me get this straight.
让我说清楚。

13:43.689 --> 13:46.448
You two ordered
a giant-screen television
你们两个下单了
一台大屏幕电视

13:46.551 --> 13:48.655
just so you could play
in the box?
只是为了让你可以玩
在盒子里？

13:48.758 --> 13:49.793
Pretty smart, huh?
很聪明，是吧？

13:49.896 --> 13:51.413
I thought it wouldn't work.
我以为这行不通。

13:51.517 --> 13:53.241
Yeah, that's quite a plan there.
是的，那是一个很好的计划。

13:53.344 --> 13:54.379
Oh, but wait...
哦，但是等等...

13:54.482 --> 13:57.655
There's something else
I wanted to ask you two.
还有别的事
我想问你们两个。

13:57.758 --> 13:59.103
Now, what was it?
现在，那是什么？

13:59.206 --> 14:00.413
Oh, yeah, yeah.
哦，是啊，是啊。

14:00.517 --> 14:03.172
Don't you two have any brains?!
你们两个都没有脑子吗？！

14:03.275 --> 14:05.655
Squidward, we don't
need television.
章鱼哥，我们不
需要电视。

14:05.758 --> 14:07.448
Not as long as we have
不只要我们有

14:07.551 --> 14:12.172
our imagina... tion.
我们的想象力。

14:12.275 --> 14:15.310
Wow! I never thought of it
that way.
哇！我从来没想过
那样。

14:15.413 --> 14:17.275
That's really something.
这确实是一件很了不起的事情。

14:17.379 --> 14:18.793
Can I have your TV?
我可以看一下你的电视吗？

14:18.896 --> 14:23.689
With imagina... tion,
I can be anything I want.
凭借想象力，
我可以成为任何我想要的人。

14:23.793 --> 14:25.586
A pirate! Arr!
海盗！啊！

14:25.689 --> 14:27.344
A football player! Hup!
一名足球运动员！哈！

14:27.448 --> 14:28.862
A starfish.
一只海星。

14:28.965 --> 14:31.137
Patrick, you're
already a starfish.
帕特里克，你是
已经是海星了。

14:31.241 --> 14:32.620
See, Squidward,
it works! You try!
瞧，章鱼哥，
它有效！你试试吧！

14:32.724 --> 14:35.137
Okay, let's see...
好吧，让我们看看...

14:35.241 --> 14:38.275
I'm imagining myself
watching TV...
我在想象自己
看电视...

14:38.379 --> 14:39.862
And there it is!
就是这样！

14:39.965 --> 14:41.275
Can I have it, SpongeBob?
我可以拥有它吗，海绵宝宝？

14:41.379 --> 14:42.275
Sure, Squidward.
当然，章鱼哥。

14:42.379 --> 14:43.413
Oh, boy, oh, boy!
哦，男孩，哦，男孩！

14:43.517 --> 14:44.517
Okay, Squidward!
好吧，章鱼哥！

14:44.551 --> 14:45.551
If you change your mind
如果你改变主意

14:45.655 --> 14:46.896
we'll be in this box.
我们会在这个盒子里。

14:47.000 --> 14:48.596
Let's play
"mountain climbing adventure"!
我们来玩吧
“登山冒险”！

14:48.620 --> 14:51.482
Let's go for it!
让我们一起努力吧！

14:51.586 --> 14:52.655
Gloves?
Check!
手套？
查看！

14:52.758 --> 14:53.827
Hats?
Check!
帽子？
查看！

14:53.931 --> 14:55.379
Underwear?
Uh... check!
内衣？
呃……检查一下！

14:55.482 --> 14:57.655
Okay, Patrick, climb up there
好吧，帕特里克，爬到那里

14:57.758 --> 14:59.482
and secure this rope.
并固定好这根绳子。

14:59.586 --> 15:00.586
You got it!
你明白了！

15:02.655 --> 15:04.620
- Patrick...
- Patrick...
- 帕特里克...
- 帕特里克...

15:04.724 --> 15:06.551
Patrick!
You're going too high!
帕特里克！
你太过分了！

15:06.655 --> 15:08.655
I hope they put
some air holes in that box.
我希望他们把
那个盒子上有一些气孔。

15:08.758 --> 15:11.379
Take it easy, Patrick!
放轻松，帕特里克！

15:11.482 --> 15:13.206
You've got to acclimate!
你必须适应！

15:13.310 --> 15:15.827
I'll take it easy when I'm dead!
等我死了我就轻松一点！

15:15.931 --> 15:19.724
I'm shaking hands with Neptune!
我正在和海王星握手！

15:19.827 --> 15:22.034
Whoo!
Excelsior!
呼！
精益求精！

15:22.137 --> 15:23.586
Where's that remote?
那个遥控器在哪里？

15:23.689 --> 15:25.689
I am the lizard
king! Whoo!
我是蜥蜴
国王！呼！

15:25.793 --> 15:27.862
Patrick? Patrick?
Patrick!
帕特里克？帕特里克？
帕特里克！

15:27.965 --> 15:31.172
I think we should
keep our voices down!
我认为我们应该
我们小声点！

15:31.275 --> 15:33.448
We might start an avalanche!
我们可能会引发雪崩！

15:33.551 --> 15:35.034
What?
什么？

15:35.137 --> 15:37.724
I said I think we should
keep our voices down
我说我认为我们应该
降低我们的声音

15:37.827 --> 15:40.517
in case of avalanches!
如果发生雪崩！

15:40.620 --> 15:41.413
What should we keep down?
我们应该保留什么？

15:41.517 --> 15:43.689
Morons.
白痴。

15:43.793 --> 15:44.586
Our voices!
我们的声音！

15:44.689 --> 15:48.241
Will you two shut up!
你们两个能不能闭嘴！

16:06.482 --> 16:07.793
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

16:15.448 --> 16:16.586
Hold me.
抱紧我。

16:16.689 --> 16:19.000
Hang in there, buddy,
the chopper is on the way!
坚持住，伙计，
直升机正在路上！

16:19.103 --> 16:21.827
SpongeBob! My legs
are frozen solid.
海绵宝宝！我的腿
被冻成固体。

16:21.931 --> 16:24.827
You'll have to cut
them off with a saw.
你必须剪掉
用锯子把它们锯掉。

16:24.931 --> 16:26.172
No, Patrick, I can't do that!
不，帕特里克，我不能那样做！

16:26.275 --> 16:27.413
Why not?
为什么不呢？

16:27.517 --> 16:30.241
Because I already cut off
my own arms.
因为我已经断了
我自己的手臂。

16:30.344 --> 16:32.000
No..!
不..！

16:32.862 --> 16:33.862
What the..?
什么..？

16:34.965 --> 16:36.655
How were you two
making that noise?!
你们两个怎么样
发出那种声音？！

16:37.551 --> 16:39.034
What noise, Squidward?
什么声音，章鱼哥？

16:39.137 --> 16:41.137
I could only hear the
sound of our laughter.
我只能听到
我们的笑声。

16:41.241 --> 16:43.896
Yes! But those sound effects:
the avalanche, the, the, the...
是的！但那些音效：
雪崩，那，那，那……

16:44.000 --> 16:44.620
Don't forget the
second avalanche.
不要忘记
第二次雪崩。

16:44.724 --> 16:48.000
Forget it!
忘了它！

16:48.103 --> 16:51.310
I don't know why
I'm wasting my time out here
我不知道为什么
我在这里浪费时间

16:51.413 --> 16:54.896
when I could be watching
my brand new television.
当我可以观看的时候
我的全新电视。

16:57.965 --> 17:01.034
- Attention, climbers!
- Please hold on!
- 登山者注意！
- 请坚持住！

17:01.137 --> 17:03.344
The saws are on the way!
锯子已经在路上了！

17:03.448 --> 17:04.448
Yay!
耶！

17:04.551 --> 17:05.551
Aha!
啊哈！

17:06.620 --> 17:08.241
How are you doing that?
你怎么样？

17:08.344 --> 17:11.000
First we establish
a base camp at 15,000 feet.
首先我们建立
海拔 15,000 英尺的大本营。

17:11.103 --> 17:13.827
The noises! How are you two
making those noises?
噪音！你们两个怎么样
发出那些声音？

17:13.931 --> 17:16.034
That's easy,
all you need is a box...
这很容易，
你所需要的只是一个盒子......

17:16.137 --> 17:20.172
And imagina... tion!
还有想象力！

17:20.275 --> 17:23.379
Are you trying to say
I have no imagination?
你想说的是
我没有想象力吗？

17:23.482 --> 17:28.000
I have more imagina... tion
in one tentacle
我有更多的想象力...
在一根触手中

17:28.103 --> 17:30.551
than you two have
in your whole bodies!
比你们两个拥有的
在你的整个身体里！

17:30.655 --> 17:31.689
That's good.
那挺好的。

17:31.793 --> 17:33.275
Now all you need is a box!
现在你需要的只是一个盒子！

17:34.827 --> 17:37.034
I'll show them!
我会告诉他们！

17:37.137 --> 17:40.103
There's got to be one in here!
这里一定有一个！

17:40.206 --> 17:42.758
Ah! This hat box
should do nicely.
啊!这个帽盒
应该做得很好。

17:46.034 --> 17:47.551
Why haven't I worn this yet?
为什么我还没穿过这个？

17:58.689 --> 18:01.000
Grr... oh...
呃……哦……

18:02.517 --> 18:04.965
Attention! We have
you surrounded!
注意力！我们有
你包围了！

18:05.068 --> 18:06.113
Come out with your hands up!
举起双手出来吧！

18:06.137 --> 18:07.827
What do they want with me?
他们想对我做什么？

18:07.931 --> 18:10.206
What did I do?
我做了什么？

18:10.310 --> 18:13.586
Obviously I violated
some new box-kicking law!
显然我违反了
一些新的踢框法！

18:13.689 --> 18:15.931
Look, officers!
Everything's okay.
各位看官们！
一切都好。

18:16.034 --> 18:17.620
I won't do it again!
我不会再这样做了！

18:17.724 --> 18:20.206
You'll never take me
alive, coppers!
你永远不会带我走
还活着，铜人！

18:20.310 --> 18:21.931
- No, Johnny!
- Don't do it!
- 不，约翰尼！
- 别这么做！

18:22.931 --> 18:24.275
Grr...
呃……

18:27.310 --> 18:29.827
Whoopee, another box!
哎呀，又一个盒子！

18:32.206 --> 18:33.827
I got to try to relax.
我得试着放松。

18:33.931 --> 18:38.896
Perhaps I can drown out their
childish games with a little TV.
也许我可以淹没他们
带着小电视的幼稚游戏。

18:39.000 --> 18:43.517
It is here that the boxes reach
their final stage of assembly.
盒子就到达这里
他们组装的最后阶段。

18:43.620 --> 18:47.103
The equation is illustrated here
by this box.
该方程如下所示
通过这个盒子。

18:47.206 --> 18:49.793
I couldn't afford
a present this year
我买不起
今年的礼物

18:49.896 --> 18:51.137
so I got you this box.
所以我给你买了这个盒子。

18:51.241 --> 18:53.034
That's what I got you!
这就是我给你的！

18:53.137 --> 18:56.482
Isn't there anything on
that isn't about boxes?!
上面没有什么东西吗
这不是盒子的事吗？！

18:56.586 --> 18:59.827
And welcome back
to Championship Boxing.
欢迎回来
到冠军拳击赛。

18:59.931 --> 19:02.206
Heh-heh! I guess this is okay.
呵呵！我想这还可以。

19:02.310 --> 19:05.000
I mean, it's not really
about boxes.
我的意思是，这并不是真的
关于盒子。

19:09.068 --> 19:10.241
I give up.
我放弃。

19:11.758 --> 19:13.038
Three... two... one...
blast off!
三……二……一……
爆炸！

19:18.310 --> 19:20.689
How are they doing that?
他们是怎么做到的？

19:20.793 --> 19:24.103
That was the most realistic
space launch I've ever heard.
这才是最现实的
我听说过太空发射。

19:24.206 --> 19:26.034
There must be an explanation.
必须有一个解释。

19:26.137 --> 19:27.137
Think, Squidward, think!
想一想，章鱼哥，想一想！

19:29.793 --> 19:31.586
Shh!
嘘！

19:34.103 --> 19:36.862
Squidward's such a jerk.
章鱼哥真是个混蛋。

19:41.137 --> 19:42.931
Laugh at me, will they?!
他们会笑我吗？

19:43.034 --> 19:44.689
All right, where is it?
好吧，它在哪里？

19:44.793 --> 19:46.896
Here I am!
我在这里！

19:47.000 --> 19:48.344
Where's what, Squidward?
什么在哪里，章鱼哥？

19:48.448 --> 19:50.206
Don't "Where's what,
Squidward?" me!
不要“什么在哪里，
章鱼哥？”我！

19:50.310 --> 19:51.931
Where's the tape recorder?
录音机在哪里？

19:52.034 --> 19:53.793
We don't have a tape
recorder, Squidward.
我们没有磁带
录音机，章鱼哥。

19:53.896 --> 19:57.000
Don't "We don't have a tape
recorder, Squidward" me.
不要“我们没有磁带
录音机，章鱼哥”我。

19:57.103 --> 19:58.172
But we don't.
但我们不这样做。

19:58.275 --> 20:00.551
We have a tape recorder box.
我们有一个录音盒。

20:00.655 --> 20:03.137
All right! Make way, you two,
I'm comin' in!
好的！你们两个让路，
我进来了！

20:03.241 --> 20:05.137
Welcome aboard, Squidward.
欢迎登上，章鱼哥。

20:05.241 --> 20:11.000
You've just set sail
on the S.S.Imagina... tion!
你刚刚起航
关于 S.S.Imagination！

20:11.103 --> 20:12.896
Where our only destination
那里是我们唯一的目的地

20:13.000 --> 20:14.310
is fantastic adventure.
是一次奇妙的冒险。

20:14.413 --> 20:16.344
Where do you want to go first?
你想先去哪里？

20:16.448 --> 20:19.517
No, no, don't mind me,
I'm just here to observe.
不不不，别介意我
我只是来观察一下。

20:19.620 --> 20:21.724
But, Squidward, don't you see?
但是，章鱼哥，你没看到吗？

20:21.827 --> 20:23.068
Waiting and watching?
等待和观看？

20:23.172 --> 20:25.310
That's not what
the box is about.
那不是什么
盒子是关于。

20:25.413 --> 20:28.862
It's about
imagina... tion!
这是关于
想象力！

20:28.965 --> 20:30.793
All right, fine!
好吧，好吧！

20:30.896 --> 20:32.517
Take me to Robot Pirate Island!
带我去机器人海盗岛！

20:32.620 --> 20:36.206
I want to arm-wrestle
with cowboys on the moon!
我想扳手腕
与牛仔一起登上月球！

20:36.310 --> 20:39.413
Just do it so I can
get back and watch TV.
只要这样做我就可以
回来看电视。

20:39.517 --> 20:43.827
Okay, Squidward,
Robot Pirate Island
it is!
好吧，章鱼哥，
机器人海盗岛
是的！

20:44.310 --> 20:45.862
Beep-beep-beep.
嘟嘟嘟。

20:45.965 --> 20:47.034
Arr...
啊...

20:47.137 --> 20:47.827
Beep-boop-beep-boop.
嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟。

20:47.931 --> 20:50.448
Ahoy, matey!
嘿，伙计！

20:50.551 --> 20:51.793
Beep-beep.
嘟嘟嘟。

20:51.896 --> 20:53.136
For that you'll walk the plank!
为此，你将走木板！

20:57.000 --> 20:58.896
Grr...
呃……

20:59.000 --> 21:02.206
Why won't this thing turn on?!
这玩意怎么打不开啊？！

21:02.310 --> 21:04.275
All right, fine!
好吧，好吧！

21:04.379 --> 21:06.931
You don't want to show me,
I don't care!
你不想给我看，
我不在乎！

21:07.034 --> 21:08.758
I've got better things to do
我还有更重要的事情要做

21:08.862 --> 21:10.034
than pace the floor
比在地板上踱步

21:10.137 --> 21:12.413
wondering how you two
work this thing.
想知道你们两个怎么样
做这件事。

21:12.517 --> 21:14.517
How do those two
work that thing?
那两个人怎么样
工作那件事？

21:14.620 --> 21:16.413
There's got to be
a secret button
一定有
一个秘密按钮

21:16.517 --> 21:18.103
or a switch or something.
或者一个开关什么的。

21:18.206 --> 21:19.310
I mean, listen to that!
我的意思是，听听！

21:21.448 --> 21:23.689
Now that sounds
like Robot Pirate Island.
现在听起来
比如机器人海盗岛。

21:23.793 --> 21:25.965
Think, Squidward, think!
想一想，章鱼哥，想一想！

21:26.068 --> 21:27.241
I got it!
我得到了它！

21:27.344 --> 21:28.793
When those two go to bed
当两人上床睡觉时

21:28.896 --> 21:31.482
I'll sneak in there
and find that button.
我会潜入那里
并找到那个按钮。

21:31.586 --> 21:35.310
I'll wait all night
if I have to!
我会等一整晚
如果我必须这样做的话！

21:42.862 --> 21:47.275
I need sleep to refuel
my imagination tanks!
我需要睡眠来补充能量
我的想象力坦克！

21:47.379 --> 21:49.034
I still can't believe
我还是不敢相信

21:49.137 --> 21:50.965
those pirates beat
all those robots!
那些海盗打败了
所有这些机器人！

21:51.068 --> 21:52.068
See you in the morning!
早上见！

21:52.137 --> 21:53.551
Good night, Patrick!
晚安，帕特里克！

22:08.206 --> 22:09.068
Hmm?
唔？

22:09.172 --> 22:10.896
Hello, what's this?
你好，这是什么？

22:11.000 --> 22:12.655
"This plaque is to commemorate
“此牌匾是为了纪念

22:12.758 --> 22:15.241
"the brave pirates
who gave their lives
“勇敢的海盗们
谁献出了生命

22:15.344 --> 22:17.104
"to keep this box safe
from the Robot Menace.
“为了保证这个盒子的安全
来自机器人的威胁。

22:17.172 --> 22:19.275
Lest we forget..."
以免我们忘记……”

22:19.379 --> 22:22.172
Oh! Got to find
that button quick!
哦！必须找到
那个按钮快！

22:22.275 --> 22:23.758
It's got to be here somewhere!
它一定就在这里的某个地方！

22:23.862 --> 22:24.517
I don't see anything!
我什么也没看到！

22:24.620 --> 22:27.103
It's just an empty box!
这只是一个空盒子！

22:27.206 --> 22:31.068
Maybe it really was
their imagination.
也许真的是
他们的想象力。

22:31.172 --> 22:32.862
Oh... get it together,
Squidward!
哦……凑齐了，
章鱼哥！

22:32.965 --> 22:33.965
What are you saying?
你在说什么？

22:34.068 --> 22:35.448
I mean, do I really believe
我的意思是，我真的相信吗？

22:35.551 --> 22:38.275
that if I sit here and
pretend to drive a race car
如果我坐在这里
假装驾驶赛车

22:38.379 --> 22:40.896
that I'm suddenly going to
start hearing noises?
我突然要
开始听到噪音？

22:43.793 --> 22:45.413
What the?
什么？

22:45.517 --> 22:47.862
It actually works!
它确实有效！

22:47.965 --> 22:49.758
I can't believe it.
我简直不敢相信。

22:49.862 --> 22:53.310
Oh, boy!
This beats TV by a long shot!
哦，孩子！
这远远胜过电视！

22:57.896 --> 23:00.310
This is the most fun
I've ever had!
这是最好玩的
我曾经有过！

23:00.413 --> 23:02.310
Listen to that, Gary.
听听，加里。

23:02.413 --> 23:05.931
Squidward finally made
the box work after all!
章鱼哥终于做出来了
毕竟盒子还能用！

23:06.034 --> 23:07.034
That is so great.
那真是太棒了。

23:12.862 --> 23:15.655
Vroom-vroom! Only two more laps
till the finish line!
呜呜！只剩下两圈了
直到终点线！

23:15.758 --> 23:18.931
I'm in the lead!
Out of my way!
我领先了！
别挡我的路！

23:19.034 --> 23:20.344
I'm almost there!
我快到了！

23:22.448 --> 23:24.896
Victory is mine!
胜利是我的！

23:25.000 --> 23:26.068
Aah!
啊啊！

23:33.172 --> 23:36.034
Hey! Our box is gone!
嘿！我们的箱子不见了！

23:36.137 --> 23:37.655
Oh, well.
那好吧。

23:37.758 --> 23:39.758
I know! Let's go
see Squidward!
我知道！我们走吧
见章鱼哥！

23:39.862 --> 23:42.620
I hope he's not too
down in the dumps today.
我希望他不要太
今天在垃圾场。

23:48.275 --> 23:51.448
And NICKELODEON
还有尼克罗迪恩

23:51.551 --> 23:55.724
Captioned by
Media Access Group at WGBH
标题为
WGBH 媒体访问小组

标题为
WGBH 媒体访问小组